  "description": "<div class=\"description-tabs tabs\">\n<div class=\"tabs__nav\">\n<div class=\"tabs__nav-item tabs__nav-item--active\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__nav-item\">Ingredients</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__nav-item\">Nutrition Facts</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__items-list\">\n<div class=\"tabs__item tabs__item--active\">\n<p>Organic strawberry flavor. Made with real Elderberry. Advanced formula proven for effective hydration plus fluid and electrolyte restoration.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__item\">\n<p>Filtered Water, Organic Coconut Water, Organic Agave Nectar, Organic Lemon Juice, Organic Vegetable Glycerin, Organic Strawberry Flavor, Sea Salt, Natural Flavors from Plants, Purple Carrot, Organic Monk Fruit Flavor, Organic Amla, Organic Sweet Potato Juice, Organic Guava, Zinc Gluconate, Organic Elderberry Juice, Organic Maqui Berries. <strong>CONTAINS: COCONUT</strong> </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__item\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2227/4617/files/Berri_Lyte_-_Advanced_Strawberry_Nutrition_Facts_480x480.png?v=1706825837\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
